# CNC - a two-panel file manager in the style of Norton Commander (Harbour-CUI)
# build.bat (Windows) / build.sh (Linux) build the library first when it is missing.
#   hbmk2 cnc.hbp
# F3 / F4 use the editor of CEdit (../cedit).

-w3 -es2
-ocnc
-i../cedit

../../hbtui.hbc
{win}hbwin.hbc
hbtip.hbc

cnc.prg
cncpanel.prg
cncnet.prg
{win}cncwin.c
../cedit/htcodeedit.prg
../cedit/cebuffer.prg
../cedit/cesyntax.prg

{unix}-lX11
